<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting, immediately after subsection (4), the following new subsection (4A): \"(4A) The chargeable income of an approved operational headquarters company, resident in Malaysia for the basis year for a year of assessment, in relation to the source consisting of the provision of qualifying services, after deduction of the tax thereon, shall be credited to an account by that company (that account and that company being referred to as the \"exempt account\" and the \"relevant company\" respectively).\"; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/37/eng@> .
